    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "McClellanville village began in the late 1860s when local plantation owners sold lots near Jeremy Creek to planters seeking relief from summer fevers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9,
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/McClellanville%2C_South_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The town of McClellanville was officially founded in 1926, with James Morrison serving as the first Intendent.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/McClellanville%2C_South_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "McClellanville's economy is now largely dependent upon the sea, reflecting its history of fishing, shrimping, and oystering.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
